  "$comment": "Single source of truth for every screening question on the site. The React form (lib/trials.ts) and the PHP validator (backend/src/Trials.php) both read this file, so the two can never drift. Add a trial here and it appears in the form, the API validator, the dashboard filters and the CSV export.",
  "trials": {
